{"html":"<div class=\"wb-page cv @container relative bg-white text-left\" data-wb-root=\"\" data-wb-post=\"42\" style=\"--brand:#4058e3;--r-card:12px;--r-btn:8px;--f-head:&#x27;Instrument Serif&#x27;, Georgia, &#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, serif;--f-display:&#x27;Instrument Serif&#x27;, Georgia, &#x27;Times New Roman&#x27;, serif;--f-body:&#x27;Inter&#x27;, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;font-family:var(--f-body)\"><section class=\"sf\" id=\"s_p1sowi9\" style=\"--bg:#ffffff;--fg:#121418;--muted:#5b616c;--hl:#4058e3;--line:#e6e7ea;--card:#f6f7f8;--accent:#4058e3;--btn-bg:#4058e3;--btn-fg:#ffffff;--btn2:#cfd2d8;--ov:#3d63f5;--ov-ink:#ffffff;background:var(--bg);color:var(--fg);margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-wb-bg=\"\"></div><div class=\"relative z-[1]\"><div style=\"padding-top:clamp(32px, 5.33cqi, 64px);padding-bottom:clamp(32px, 5.33cqi, 64px);padding-left:40px;padding-right:40px;max-width:760px;margin-inline:auto;width:100%;position:relative\"><div class=\"grid @max-3xl:grid-cols-1!\" style=\"grid-template-columns:repeat(1, minmax(0, 1fr));column-gap:16px;row-gap:28px;justify-items:flex-start;align-items:stretch\"><div class=\"cell relative flex flex-col\"><div class=\"group/cell relative flex h-full flex-col\" style=\"justify-content:center;text-align:left\"><div class=\"ed\" style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:400;letter-spacing:-0.01em;line-height:1.02;font-size:clamp(24px, 3.00cqi, 36px)\"><h1>WordPress, at the speed of Go</h1></div></div></div><div class=\"cell relative flex flex-col\" style=\"justify-self:stretch\"><div class=\"group/cell relative flex h-full flex-col\" style=\"justify-content:center;text-align:left\"><div class=\"ed\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><img alt=\"Hands typing on a laptop with a web interface open\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1782898669223-ab17b600d486?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;w=1400&amp;q=80\" width=\"1400\" height=\"933\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"block size-full object-cover\" style=\"aspect-ratio:1.78;border-radius:var(--r-card)\"/></div></div></div><div class=\"cell relative flex flex-col\" style=\"justify-self:stretch\"><div class=\"group/cell relative flex h-full flex-col\" style=\"justify-content:center;text-align:left\"><div class=\"ed\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><div class=\"relative\"><div class=\"text-[17px] leading-[1.75] [&amp;&gt;*:first-child]:mt-0 [&amp;&gt;*:last-child]:mb-0 [&amp;_p]:my-5 [&amp;_h2]:mb-3 [&amp;_h2]:mt-10 [&amp;_h2]:text-[1.6em] [&amp;_h2]:font-semibold [&amp;_h2]:leading-tight [&amp;_h3]:mb-2 [&amp;_h3]:mt-8 [&amp;_h3]:text-[1.3em] [&amp;_h3]:font-semibold [&amp;_h4]:mt-6 [&amp;_h4]:font-semibold [&amp;_ul]:my-5 [&amp;_ul]:list-disc [&amp;_ul]:pl-6 [&amp;_ol]:my-5 [&amp;_ol]:list-decimal [&amp;_ol]:pl-6 [&amp;_li]:my-1 [&amp;_blockquote]:my-7 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-l-4 [&amp;_blockquote]:border-(--line) [&amp;_blockquote]:pl-5 [&amp;_blockquote]:italic [&amp;_img]:h-auto [&amp;_img]:max-w-full [&amp;_figure]:my-7 [&amp;_figcaption]:mt-2 [&amp;_figcaption]:text-[14px] [&amp;_figcaption]:text-(--muted) [&amp;_a]:underline [&amp;_a]:underline-offset-2 [&amp;_pre]:my-6 [&amp;_pre]:overflow-x-auto [&amp;_code]:font-mono [&amp;_code]:text-[0.9em] [&amp;_hr]:my-10 [&amp;_hr]:border-(--line) [&amp;_table]:my-6 [&amp;_table]:w-full [&amp;_td]:border [&amp;_td]:border-(--line) [&amp;_td]:p-2 [&amp;_th]:border [&amp;_th]:border-(--line) [&amp;_th]:p-2\"><p>Pursae keeps the parts of WordPress people rely on and rewrites the rest in Go: one binary, one PostgreSQL database and plugins that run in a WebAssembly sandbox.</p>\n<h2>Why a rewrite?</h2>\n<p>Most sites spend their time waiting on PHP workers and on the database. A compiled server with a connection pool answers the same pages with a fraction of the memory.</p>\n<ul><li>The dashboard and the block editor work as before.</li><li>Themes and menus keep their familiar shape.</li><li>Caching is built in.</li></ul>\n<blockquote><p>We moved forty sites in an afternoon and our hosting bill halved.</p></blockquote>\n<p>Read the migration guide to move an existing site, or start fresh with the built-in theme.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"cell relative flex flex-col\" style=\"justify-self:stretch\"><div class=\"group/cell relative flex h-full flex-col\" style=\"justify-content:center;text-align:left\"><div class=\"ed\" style=\"font-size:16px\"><div class=\"p-6\" style=\"border:1.5px dashed var(--line);border-radius:var(--r-card)\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[18px] font-semibold\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-circle\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.992 16.342a2 2 0 0 1 .094 1.167l-1.065 3.29a1 1 0 0 0 1.236 1.168l3.413-.998a2 2 0 0 1 1.099.092 10 10 0 1 0-4.777-4.719\"></path></svg>4</p><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-3 h-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"width:78%;background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--fg) 8%, transparent)\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-3 h-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"width:62%;background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--fg) 8%, transparent)\"></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"mt-3 h-2.5 rounded-full\" style=\"width:70%;background:color-mix(in srgb, var(--fg) 8%, transparent)\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div>","css":"","classes":["@container","@max-3xl:grid-cols-1!","[&>*:first-child]:mt-0","[&>*:last-child]:mb-0","[&_a]:underline","[&_a]:underline-offset-2","[&_blockquote]:border-(--line)","[&_blockquote]:border-l-4","[&_blockquote]:italic","[&_blockquote]:my-7","[&_blockquote]:pl-5","[&_code]:font-mono","[&_code]:text-[0.9em]","[&_figcaption]:mt-2","[&_figcaption]:text-(--muted)","[&_figcaption]:text-[14px]","[&_figure]:my-7","